OL,3,GNEWSASir Tom Jones cancels US shows
OL,4,Aafter 'bad case of the flu'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA later post said that a show in
OL,7,FSacramento on Saturday, and San
OL,8,FFrancisco on Sunday, would also be
OL,9,Fpostponed "following further advice
OL,10,Ffrom my doctor".
